{"4823380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eyes Of The Factory", "steam_appid": 4823380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FACTORY NEVER FORGOT YOU.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>NOW IT WANTS YOU BACK.</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadows of Blackforge Industries, something never shut down. You return to the abandoned factory where rusted machines still breathe, forgotten halls still whisper, and unseen eyes follow every step. What was once a place of industry has become something else entirely—silent, broken, and waiting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some secrets were buried in steel. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some never stopped watching you.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4823380/extras/e21caa110f3d63f2d487f9866de92216.avif?t=1786743352\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FACTORY NEVER FORGOT YOU.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>NOW IT WANTS YOU BACK.</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadows of Blackforge Industries, something never shut down. You return to the abandoned factory where rusted machines still breathe, forgotten halls still whisper, and unseen eyes follow every step. What was once a place of industry has become something else entirely—silent, broken, and waiting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some secrets were buried in steel. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some never stopped watching you.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4823380/extras/e21caa110f3d63f2d487f9866de92216.avif?t=1786743352\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore the abandoned Blackforge Industries factory and uncover the dark secrets hidden within its walls